# ── CDN: models.now.audio ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Cloudflare R2 bucket: webgpu-vision
# Custom domain: models.now.audio (R2 DNS record in now.audio zone)
# CORS: allow all origins GET
# COEP/COOP headers: set via Cloudflare Transform Rule
#
# Upload (MUST use --remote, without it wrangler silently writes to local emulator):
#   cd models/
#   npx wrangler r2 object put webgpu-vision/<path> --file <local-path> \
#     --content-type application/octet-stream --remote
#
# model-urls.js auto-switches: localhost -> /models/, production -> models.now.audio
# Local models/ dir structure mirrors R2 paths exactly.
.wrangler/
